cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the FungiCirno code or model artifacts, please cite the project report below and cite the original Charisis dataset separately."
title: "FungiCirno: Instance Segmentation and Cluster-Level Growth Monitoring of Oyster Mushrooms"
abstract: >-
  FungiCirno evaluates instance segmentation for oyster mushroom cluster
  delineation, image-space geometric measurement, temporal identity association,
  and cluster-level growth-history analysis. The project compares a fine-tuned
  YOLO26-L-seg model with a Mask R-CNN implementation using a ConvNeXt-Tiny-FPN
  backbone and provides a reproducibility notebook and pretrained model artifacts.
